ng herself permanently from human contact. This is because the drug's true effect is to make the user impossible to recognize even if they are in front of them, rather than simple invisibility. In the distant past, Chitose was Empress Regnant of a small nation and used the drug, received from a sage, for stress relief. At the end it is revealed the drug she took is canceled and she has reverted back."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"At the end of her route she is revealed to be engaged to Haruki and she has became Matsuyuki Chitose (待雪 チトセ)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87160"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネットのみで爆発的な人気を誇るスーパーアイドル。動画の再生数、登録者数も半端ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まるでネットそのものに住んでいるかのようなリアル配信が武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまりのカリスマに恋する視聴者続出だが、生身を誰も見たことがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし晴季の前に度々現れては意味深に煽って来たり、透明人間になってエッチなことをするのをオススメしてきたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな謎多きスーパーアイドル。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22116","sourceWorkId":"28936","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネットのみで爆発的な人気を誇る"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スーパーアイドル。動画の再生数、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"登録者数も半端ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まるでネットそのものに"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"住んでいるかのようなリアル配信が武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまりのカリスマに恋する視聴者続出だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生身を誰も見たことがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし晴季の前に度々現れては"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意味深に煽って来たり、透明人間になって"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エッチなことをするのを"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オススメしてきたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな謎多きスーパーアイドル。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73604"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22116","sourceWorkId":"28936","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22116","sourceWorkId":"28936","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22116"